@coderabbitai Added the missing `[3.39.79]` comparison reference in `CHANGELOG.md:23834` in commit f80c97f3a, pushed to the PR branch. The definition follows the existing format and compares v3.39.78 to v3.39.79; no release metadata or provenance labels were changed.

Verified with `git diff --check`, a focused heading/reference uniqueness check, and `markdownlint-diff-helper.sh --base 813ed987628790240c8be5af075a0b2a5b144f62 --head HEAD` (zero new violations). Push-hook typecheck also passed. Live comparison availability could not be verified because GitHub currently returns 404 for those tag refs.

