@coderabbitai Addressed in commit 980735ad7. Verified the finding against the host-generated anchor handling in `compaction-replay-collect.mjs:25-39`. The annotator now skips messages containing a compaction part (`.agents/plugins/opencode-aidevops/turn-time-annotation.mjs:46-47`).

The regression case at `.agents/plugins/opencode-aidevops/tests/test-turn-time-annotation.mjs:28-36` verifies the anchor stays unchanged while an adjacent interactive turn is annotated. All 5 focused tests pass with `node --test .agents/plugins/opencode-aidevops/tests/test-turn-time-annotation.mjs`; syntax checks and `git diff --check` also pass. Push hooks deferred repository typecheck to CI because `tsc` is not installed locally.

